// v1.7.2 — Sidecar analysis.json optimisation:
//   - Check for sidecar analysis.json next to the .blend file FIRST
//     (generated by MapLink_Blender addon on save). Eliminates Blender
//     launch for dependency graph building on fresh machines / first import.
//   - Falls back to plugin Logs cache, then Blender launch as before.
//
// v1.4.5 — Optimisation:
//   - Skip Blender analyze launch during graph building if analysis.json
//     exists AND the .blend file hash hasn't changed (cached from last import).

